Id: nfs015w
Severity: WARN
Category: network
Check: check_nfsd
Fix: Stop the NFS server (systemctl disable --now nfs-server), or export what it should serve.
References: exports(5); rpc.nfsd(8)
Controls: CIS 3.3, 4.8; NIST AC-3, CM-7; ISO 8.3, 8.21; CE Secure configuration

NFS serves clients but /etc/exports exports nothing: an attack
surface with no purpose. Every RPC service answering the network can
have flaws, and NFS has had serious ones; a server nobody should use
should not run. Stop it, or export what it should serve.
